<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>签署完成 - <%= contractTitle %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/bootstrap/css/bootstrap.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/vendor/bootstrap-icons/bootstrap-icons.css">
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif; background:#f5f6fa; min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:24px; }
    .done-card { background:#fff; border-radius:16px; box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.08); padding:40px 24px; max-width:400px; width:100%; text-align:center; }
    .icon-wrap { width:80px; height:80px; border-radius:50%; background:#d1f5dd; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; margin:0 auto 20px; }
    .icon-wrap i { font-size:40px; color:#198754; }
    h4 { margin-bottom:8px; color:#333; }
    .text-muted { font-size:.9rem; }
    .info { background:#f8f9fa; border-radius:10px; padding:16px; margin:20px 0; text-align:left; font-size:.9rem; }
    .info div { margin:6px 0; }
    .btn-download { width:100%; padding:14px; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:600; border-radius:10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="done-card">
    <div class="icon-wrap"><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i></div>
    <h4>签署完成</h4>
    <p class="text-muted"><strong><%= contractTitle %></strong> 已由 <%= partyName %> 完成签署</p>
    <div class="info">
      <div><strong>签署人：</strong><%= partyName %></div>
      <div><strong>时间：</strong><%= new Date().toLocaleString('zh-CN') %></div>
    </div>
    <a href="/sign/<%= token %>/download" class="btn btn-primary btn-download"><i class="bi bi-download"></i> 下载已签署合同</a>
    <p class="text-muted small mt-3">合同已生效，建议保存备份。如需查看完整合同，请在系统案件详情页查看。</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>